[11.324619, "o", "\u001b[38;5;244m╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\u001b[37mDefault\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — Does what was asked. Answers for everything it touched, and nothing else.\u001b[0m            \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\u001b[37mSenior-dev\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — Does what the result needs, not only what was asked. Never makes a point of it.\u001b[0m   \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\u001b[37mFriendly Developer\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — The same work, but you are never left alone with the result.\u001b[0m              \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\u001b[37mPerfectionist\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — Quality is part of the task, not a task for later. Pays in time.\u001b[0m               \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[92m❯ \u001b[0m\u001b[1;92mParanoid\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — An outage costs more than time spent checking. Looks before irreversible steps.\u001b[0m     \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\u001b[37mMinimalist\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — Every line is an obligation for years. Extends a task only toward deletion.\u001b[0m       \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\u001b[37mExplainer\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — A fix it cannot explain is no different from a wrong one. Finds the cause.\u001b[0m         \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\u001b[37mFast-and-dirty\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;249m — A prototype may be bad if it is honestly called one. Says so first.\u001b[0m           \u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m│\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;244m  \u001b[0m\